# api_land_in_rc_takeoff.scn — `land` while an RC-started auto-takeoff is in TAKEOFF (no blocking command is waiting): it is held until the takeoff has ended, then runs
#                              RC の ARM が始めた自動離陸の TAKEOFF 中の `land`（待機中のコマンドは無い）: 離陸が終わるまで保留され、その後に実行される
#
# The ARM button in ALT_HOLD starts the auto-takeoff; the API `land` is an ordinary line read by the main loop (cmdLand), not one parked during a `takeoff` wait. StateManager::notifyLandingRequest does not accept TAKEOFF
# (a LANDING that begins on the floor can float the craft up, detailed_design.md §3 note 5), so cmdLand holds the request until the TAKEOFF has left (hasLeftTakeoff): the takeoff completes (TAKEOFF -> FLYING), the land is issued
# (FLYING -> LANDING -> IDLE_GROUND) and answered "ok" at the touchdown. A request published in TAKEOFF would be ignored and answered "error land timeout" after 20 s.
# Spec under test (detailed_design.md §3 note 13).
#
# RC の ARM ボタン（ALT_HOLD）が自動離陸を始める。API の `land` は主ループが読む普通の行（cmdLand）で、`takeoff` の待機中に後回しにした行ではない。StateManager::notifyLandingRequest は TAKEOFF を受け付けない
# （床の上で始めた LANDING は機体を浮かせうる。detailed_design.md §3 注5）ので、cmdLand は TAKEOFF を抜けるまで（hasLeftTakeoff）要求を保留する: 離陸が完了し（TAKEOFF -> FLYING）、着陸を発行し
# （FLYING -> LANDING -> IDLE_GROUND）、接地で "ok" を返す。TAKEOFF で要求を発行すると無視され、20 s 後に "error land timeout" を返してしまう。
# 検証する仕様（detailed_design.md §3 注13）。
#
# Timeline: ARM at 5.5 s (spool, the TAKEOFF begins at about 5.8 s), land at 5.95 s (the climb is under way), the touchdown within about 10 s.
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/api_land_in_rc_takeoff.scn --target vehicle --duration 34000000
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt>
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                 # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1        # B: ALT switch ON while disarmed -> ground mode change
   +    api        "command"                                                     # C: enter SDK mode (t=5.5)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     450       50        1        # D: ARM in ALT_HOLD -> spool -> auto-takeoff (to t=5.95)
   +    api        "land"                                                        # E: t=5.95 s — land while the RC-started takeoff is in TAKEOFF
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1        # F: the takeoff completes, then the land runs
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     24000     50        1        # G: release ARM; the landing ends and the craft rests (to t=34)
